00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:02,900
and lie about it to your wife!

2
00:00:04,604 --> 00:00:06,334
(Girl:)Sorry for eavesdropping,
but did you know

3
00:00:06,340 --> 00:00:08,970
(Girl:)they actually had
the song “Let It Go” in place

4
00:00:08,975 --> 00:00:10,605
(Girl:)before they finalized the story?

5
00:00:10,610 --> 00:00:13,040
(Raj:)Yeah, that's true. In fact,
they liked the song so much,

6
00:00:13,046 --> 00:00:14,646
