7
00:00:14,648 --> 00:00:16,578
(Girl:)Which is probably
why that movie sucks.

8
00:00:16,583 --> 00:00:18,813
(Howard:)Here we are
talking about Frozen,

9
00:00:18,819 --> 00:00:20,219
(Howard:)and yet, you got burned.

10
00:00:20,220 --> 00:00:22,350
Miss, I'm so sorry.

11
00:00:22,356 --> 00:00:23,826
(Raj:)How can you not like that movie?

12
00:00:23,824 --> 00:00:25,824
(Girl:)I just think it gets more credit
than it deserves.

13
00:00:25,826 --> 00:00:27,326
(Howard:)Oh, that's what I said
an hour ago.

14
00:00:27,327 --> 00:00:31,097
(Girl:)Wow. You've been talking
about Frozen for an hour?

15
00:00:32,132 --> 00:00:35,502
(Howard:)You should've seen us
after The Good Dinosaur.

16
00:00:35,502 --> 00:00:39,342
(Raj:)It was a classic western
set in the post-Jurassic period,

17
00:00:39,339 --> 00:00:42,009
(Raj:)and it changed my life.

18
